    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook saga is a cooperative restaurant management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers as quickly as possible, earn stars as you complete levels, unlock your trade and new skills to help your team succeed in increasingly intense levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each day, customize your restaurant to respond more effectively to the types of customer that arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently three unlockable professions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chef: he unlocks raw materials to cook healthier and, above all, more economically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waiter: has a whole range of skills to satisfy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Storekeeper: buys and manages the restaurant, with commercial skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the level, the game can be played by between 4 and 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook saga is a cooperative restaurant management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers as quickly as possible, earn stars as you complete levels, unlock your trade and new skills to help your team succeed in increasingly intense levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each day, customize your restaurant to respond more effectively to the types of customer that arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently three unlockable professions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chef: he unlocks raw materials to cook healthier and, above all, more economically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waiter: has a whole range of skills to satisfy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Storekeeper: buys and manages the restaurant, with commercial skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the level, the game can be played by between 4 and 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Learn new skills, buy counter, upgrade your restaurant, and COOK, COOK until there is no more customer. Cook saga is a game about skill and financial decision making for still be here tomorrow.",
